  "description": "Years of production: 2022 (one batch, limited edition)\n\nDiscontinued, sold out, limited edition. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Escapade.\n\nThe Escapade 853 Taiwan was a one-batch-only limited edition using Reynolds 853 steel (DZB down tube, Ovalform top tube), around 70g lighter than the standard Gen5 Escapade depending on size, with another level of compliance and comfort. Available in Lichen and Damson matte colours only, now sold out. Shared the Gen5 platform: Cotic RB5 full carbon fork with 3 \"Anything Cage\" bosses per leg, 142x12 rear thru axle, Inside Out cable routing (including Di2), and a wide +2.5mm gravel chainline for extra tyre clearance. Hand made in Taiwan. A separate limited UK-built version in Reynolds 853 also existed (see Archive: Escapade UK853).",
